questions.stem:
Distinguish between the Mudarabah model and the Wakalah model for Takaful operations. In each case, explain:
(a) how the Takaful operator earns its compensation;
(b) who owns the underwriting surplus of the Participants' Risk Fund; and (c) the principal advantage and disadvantage of the model from the perspectives of the operator and the participant. Which model is dominant in Nigeria and why?
